      "message": "1. I think this will end up as min(max board speed, Gen2) before mode discovery and min(max board speed, mode VDO speed) after mode discovery. is_tbt_cable_supespeed returns true for active cables, which should avoid the return-0 case in get_tbt_cable_speed.\n2. AFAICT, this will result in the same value of r_v2-\u003ecable_speed that it would have had prior to this change except in cases before the mux has entered a mode. In those cases, it would have been 0, and now it will be Gen2 or Gen3, depending on discovery status/contents.",
